{"id":17573,"name":"Onslow County","slug":"onslow-county","state":"North Carolina","code":"NC","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/north-carolina-tax-deed-sales/onslow-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:51:18","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium bid","deposit":"20% of the winning bid","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"No fixed schedule; check local announcements"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Onslow County Tax Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Onslow County Auctions"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"4KEBgwTkyMNzfvGhj0LXocHCe\"><iframe title=\"40-90% Off! Tax Sale Treasures - Onslow County - North Carolina Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uw-Z5dYgHiU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">40-90% Off! Tax Sale Treasures &#8211; Onslow County &#8211; North Carolina Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Are you looking to break into real estate at a bargain price? Check out Onslow County, North Carolina&#8217;s Tax Foreclosure Sales. You could land a property for 40 to 90% below its market value. Here&#8217;s how:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Foreclosure-Sales\">Understanding Tax Foreclosure Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Once taxes are overdue, Onslow County auctions off properties. Auctions aren&#8217;t on a fixed schedule, so stay tuned to The Jacksonville Daily News for auction dates. They&#8217;re held at the Onslow County courthouse in Jacksonville right at noon.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Basics of the Auction:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Highest Bidder Wins:</strong> To win, you must be the highest bidder and put down a 20% deposit immediately.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Upset Bid Period:</strong> After the auction, there&#8217;s a 10-day upset bid period where someone can outbid you by at least 5% or $750.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>As-Is Sales:</strong> All sales are as-is, meaning no guarantees on the property&#8217;s condition or title clarity.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Steps to Start Tax Deed Investing</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s crucial to know the legal framework in your target area.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Key regulations to consider are the auction procedures and property redemption periods.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Visit the <a href=\"https://www.onslowcountync.gov/289/Foreclosures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Onslow County Foreclosures Page</mark></a> and the <a href=\"https://www.onslowcountync.gov/269/Tax-Office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Onslow County Tax Office</mark></a> for detailed information.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here, you can find information on upcoming auctions, sale schedules, and parcel inquiries.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Stay updated by regularly checking the <a href=\"https://www.onslowcountync.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">county auction site</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read the Details About Tax Deeds:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiries, and other essential details before participating in an auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>For any additional inquiries, contact the Onslow County Tax Office at (910) 989-3000.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Onslow-County-Courthouse-North-Carolina-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17579 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Onslow County Courthouse North Carolina\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Due Diligence:</strong> Before bidding, thoroughly inspect the property and verify its legal status.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Budget Wisely:</strong> Ensure you have enough funds to cover the deposit and any additional costs like recording fees and revenue stamps.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay Informed:</strong> Keep an eye on local newspapers like The Jacksonville Daily News for auction announcements.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if someone outbids me during the upset bid period?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: If someone places an upset bid, you can increase your bid or let the other bidder take the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Are there any guarantees on the properties?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: No, all properties are sold as-is without any guarantees on their condition or title.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How can I stay updated on auction dates?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Regularly check the Onslow County website and local newspapers for updates on auction dates and properties available.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.onslowcountync.gov/289/Foreclosures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Onslow County Foreclosures</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.onslowcountync.gov/269/Tax-Office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Onslow County Tax Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/north-carolina-tax-deed-sales/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">How to Unlock Profits and Secure Real Estate Deals in North Carolina Tax Deeds</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-investing-overview/understanding-tax-deed-investing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Let’s talk about Tax Deeds and how you can profit from them!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ES5Z